            "review_title": "Review at SumVilla Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Donovan O\nBangkok, Thailand184 contributions\n0\nPleasantly Surprised by the Mixed Seafood Fried Rice\nSep 2016 • Solo\nI stopped at Sumvilla for the beginning of a package tour to Sapa, Vietnam. When I first glanced over the menu it was not very extensive and that bummed me out. I decided to have a beer, Vietnam coffee and some mixed seafood fried rice. \nOnce the food came I was blown away by presentation and I was even more impressed with the taste. It is no grand experience and in my opinion that is the mark of good regular food.\nThe pricing was reasonable and the staff did a great job keeping up with me amidst the large group I was with. When I am in Hanoi again i will visit for a more pleasant experience with less people!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 4, 2016",
