            "review_text": "Jolie283\nHanoi, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nStrongly recommend\nJun 2016 • Family\nI have been here a couple of times and enjoyed a lot. The restaurant is located next to the west lake which is away from the crowd of the city center. A couple meal or family/friends or even business meal are suitable. Great food, freat service, beautiful view. I strongly recommend to enjoy the meal with black chicken hot hot or grilled west lake tiger prawns. And the restaurant's view is more gorgeous in the evening. Definitively a place to recommend.\nRead more\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 1, 2016",
