            "review_title": "Review at SumVilla Restaurant",
            "review_text": "DoHanh152\nVietnam4 contributions\n0\nNice Restaurant near WestLake\nMar 2016 • Friends\nI usually don't have faith in Vietnamese street food serving in restaurant but I have changed my mind when coming to Sum Villa. I accidentally had a meal here with my Riding Club when we were stopping to find a place to have breakfast, which was an insane experience. We had the restaurant special dish Bun Bo Hue - Hue's beef noodles with sweet broth with only VND39,000. They have free drink for every breakfast portion weekdays. From that time, this is our favourite place to come.\n\nThe restaurant space is quite beautiful, romantic and so greeny which makes us feel more close to the mother nature. The 2nd floor is the venue for weddings, which is quite big and elegant with nice decorations and clean set up. \n\nThe staffs were courteous but faintly aloof, but the manager was so friendly to go talk to us.\n\nNext time, we may come to try the night menu.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 12, 2016",
