            "review_text": "Hoang A\nHanoi, Vietnam16 contributions\n0\nnice view and ideals beer place\nSep 2015 • Friends\nI was there in last year,the place was good for us to enjoy summer's weather cause the restaurant stayed beside the West lake but it might get a little bit cold in the winter. . Moreover, the beer and food were so fresh and the price was so reasonable for us, we had some bottle of beers, few chicken wings and some smoked sausage and a big hotpot.. However they place for kids was so small, not enough area to play so you should consider when bring the kids.\nRead more\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 5, 2016",
