            "review_title": "Review at SumVilla Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Ha P\nHanoi5 contributions\n0\nNice and peaceful restaurant located in the West of Hanoi City\nMar 2016 • Family\nWe always feel comfortable and relaxing in every time we were at Sum Villa restaurant. It is located in the ideal place of the West of Hanoi with the very nice view to the peaceful West lake and the great ambience with the wide exposure to the nature.The food are delicious, especially the signature dish of the Australian beef with red wine sauce is highly applauded. Bravo Chef! You can enjoy your meal both inside or outside in the garden.The staff are very friendly and attentive to attend the requests. I heard that there is a wedding convention upstairs and it is also fully booked in the wedding season and the swimming pool next door. It is rather difficult to find any similar place in the bustling Hanoi city now. Surely we will come back again.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 25, 2016",
